Symp's Upscale
==============

This software is a modified version of Upscayl (https://github.com/upscayl/upscayl),
licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0).

The full text of the AGPL-3.0 license is provided in the LICENSE file.

As required by the AGPL-3.0, the source code of this modified version is
publicly available at: https://github.com/OVZegla/Upscaler

Modifications made from the original Upscayl codebase include:
- Rebranding to "Symp's Upscale"
- Migration to Tauri 2.x backend
- Redesigned user interface
- French language as default
- Progress bar and cancel improvements
- Various UX and display fixes

